\pard\b\fs28 Holy Is His Name\b0\fs22\par
\par
My soul proclaims the greatness of the Lord\par
And my spirit exalts in God my savior\par
For He has looked with mercy on my lowliness\par
And my name will be forever exalted\par
\par
For the mighty God has done great things for me\par
And His mercy will reach from age to age\par
\par
And holy, holy, holy is His name.\par
\par
\par
He has mercy in every generation\par
He has revealed His power and His glory\par
He has cast down the mighty in their arrogance\par
And has lifted up the meek and the lonely\par
\par
He has come to help His servant Israel\par
He remembered His promise to our fathers\par
\par
And holy, holy, holy is His name.\par
Holy, holy, holy is His name\par
}